# Expo Router screens

- One route per file in `src/app/`; use `_layout.tsx` for navigators and shared providers for that subtree.
- Import `Link`, `router`, and `useLocalSearchParams` from `expo-router`.
- Keep screens thin: compose `@/components/*` and hooks; avoid large inline UI or data layers in route files.
- Use `router.push` / `router.replace` for imperative navigation; `Link` for tappable navigation.
- Do not add non-route modules under `src/app/` — they become accidental routes.
